OL,3,GNEWSAGrant for museum display amid
OL,4,Areparation calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum has received a #100,000 grant
OL,7,Fto revisit its links with an African
OL,8,Fcommunity amid a campaign for
OL,9,Freparations.
OL,11,FKendal Museum features a display of
OL,12,Fhunting trophies from western Kenya
OL,13,Fdonated by Colonel Edgar Garston
OL,14,FHarrison, a British Army officer who
OL,15,Fserved there between 1895 and 1905.
OL,17,FResearch from sociologist Dr Joe Rigby,
OL,18,Fan expert in the social and
OL,19,Fenvironmental history of Cumbria,
OL,20,Fdiscovered links between the collection
OL,21,Fand a campaign for reparations from the
OL,22,FNandi community in Kenya.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
