OL,3,GNEWSAGrant for museum display amid
OL,4,Areparation calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the project set up with
OL,7,Fthe grant, the Nandi community was
OL,8,F"cleared" from about 1,235 sq miles
OL,9,F(3,200 sq km) by Harrison's troops, who
OL,10,Fdestroyed their crops, homes and seized
OL,11,Flivestock.
